{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/10919","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"ND237.M24 N4","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"10919","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"John Marin: watercolors, oil paintings, etchings.","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Museum of Modern Art (MoMA)","id":"actor/museum-of-modern-art","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1936","begin_of_the_begin":"1936-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1936-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq copy : good condition ; dust jacket : fair condition.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Ephemera found inside back cover : newspaper article Marin Paints at Home from unknown source.\nEphemera found inside front cover : 4 photographs : Alfred Stieglitz and John Marin, undated attached to Letters of John Marin order form ; Alfred Stieglitz and John Marin, undated wrapped in tissue paper ; John Marin by Alfred Stieglitz, undated attached to an American Place exhbition announcement ; John Marin by Alfred Stieglitz, undated mounted.\nEphemera found inside front cover : exhibition announcement : Leonard Baskin : Drawings and Some Sculpture, March 22-April 16, 1966 ; advertisement : Additional Writing on John Marin ; leaflet : To my Paint Children by John Marin, February 14, 1938 ; leaflet : Pertaining to New York Circus and Pink Ladies by John Marin, December 1941 with A Letter from John Marin enclosed ; Bulletin of The Museum of Modern Art : Marin Exhibition, October, 1936 (F-15:02-30.rc).\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nTwo thousand five hundred copies of this catalog were printed for the Trustees of The Museum of Modern Art by the Spiral Press, New York.--Colophon.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}